{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d8933f85-c485-89c0-9ccf-e1f4e615b13e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T10:51:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colleen Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:49:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:49:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise, Colleen Dolan. I'm calling about a dip in the road, and I'm going to talk fast because I have a client sitting under a dryer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, go ahead, I'm with you. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 261 Van Zandt Avenue, in the North End. Right out front of the building. I manage the property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "261 Van Zandt. And what's it doing, a pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not exactly a pothole. [line breaks up] there was a utility trench dug across there last year, and it's settled. So now there's a dip, about [inaudible] long, maybe two inches down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me. About how long was the dip?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I wrote it down. Roughly four feet across, two inches deep. And it's right in the bike lane. Cyclists swerve into the traffic lane to miss it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, in the bike lane, got it. Did the storm make it worse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the coastal storm Friday and Saturday. Water sat in it and the edge is breaking up now. It was just a dip before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. I'll put in a work order for Van Zandt, trench settlement in the bike lane, edge breaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. How long do repairs usually take? Because this isn't the first I've noticed it, and I'd rather not wait months."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It really varies. After a storm the crews have a backlog, and a trench patch can depend on who dug it. I'd say days to a few weeks, but I can't give you a date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks. Well, fine. [crosstalk] Sorry, go on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you go. Do you want a callback number on the order?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0167. Colleen Dolan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0167. Someone may call if they need to find the spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, Denise. I have to go, my client is baking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go, go. Bye now."
    }
  ],
